     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\sqrt {550}  = \\sqrt {25} \\sqrt {22}  = 5\\sqrt {22} \"></span></p>\n<p>The rational part is 5.</p>\n<p>The irrational part is <span data-math=\"\\sqrt {22} \"></span>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"5\\sqrt {22}\">5\\sqrt {22}</span>. The rational part is 5, and the irrational part is <span data-math=\"\\sqrt {22} \">\\sqrt {22}</span>."
    }
